.TH GPS 1 2000-1月 "gene_means" "gene_means"
.SH NAME
gene_means \- Get the per gene mean of the preprocessed expression data (log-CPM scale).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIgene_means(\fBgps\fR as <generic> GPSModel);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the per gene mean of the preprocessed expression data (log-CPM scale).
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgps\fB \fR\- the trained model object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a numeric vector, one value per modelled gene.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
Together with \fBGPS::gene_sds\fR this vector defines the z-score normalization of the
 model: `z = (log2(cpm + 1) - mean) / sd`. External context profiles must be
 normalized with exactly these two vectors before they are injected via \fBGPS::set_context\fR.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GPS
